    fix(dbgap059): add orphaned scratch-daemon reaper and curl timeout
    
    DB-GAP-059: Integration suite leaks orphaned daemons that burn 4+ GB
    RSS and 41% CPU. Three defects fixed:
    
    (a) Curl probes now bounded with --max-time 10 (tests/helpers.ts:curl),
        mirroring INT-CI-003's waitForUrl fix. Timed-out probes fail the
        test instead of pinning the suite.
    
    (b) Process-level reaper (src/testing/orphan-daemon-reaper.ts) kills
        orphaned duckbrain http processes that survived their parent.
        Called in globalSetup/startup and teardown sweeps.
    
    (c) startDuckbrainHttp now pins DUCKBRAIN_NAMESPACES_PATH,
        DUCKBRAIN_DATA_DIR, and DUCKBRAIN_CONFIG_PATH to isolated temp dirs
        so scratch daemons never inherit host config (227 namespaces).
    
    ACs verified:
    - AC1: curl probes have --max-time (grep verifies 425)
    - AC2: scratch daemons pin isolated namespace root + port (grep verifies 223-238)
    - AC3: reaper imported and called in global-setup (grep verifies 37,48,73)
    - AC4: reaper exported and unit-tested (src/testing/orphan-daemon-reaper.test.ts)
    
    Files: helpers.ts, global-setup.integration.ts, http-e2e.int.test.ts,
           orphan-daemon-reaper.ts, orphan-daemon-reaper.test.ts,
           orphan-reaper.int.test.ts
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
